# Pairs with ReadPositionHonest. A reactivated leaf live-advances before its
# replay has read the entries it owns from an earlier activation, so its read
# position passes an acknowledged write it does not hold.
MODULE: ReadPositionHonestLiveAdvanceUnarmed
TARGET: ReadPositionHonest
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the live advance does not wait for the replay to reach the leaf's own appends
PERTURBS: LiveAdvance

--- FIND
    /\ LiveArmed(l)
    /\ Max(own[l]) > rp[l]
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: any activation may live-advance.
    /\ TRUE
    /\ Max(own[l]) > rp[l]
--- END
